#: ../../zh/triton_api/Compiler_Hint_Ops/debug_barrier.md:3
msgid "1. 函数概述"
msgstr "1. Function Overview"

#: ../../zh/triton_api/Compiler_Hint_Ops/debug_barrier.md:5
msgid ""
"`debug_barrier` "
"插入一条屏障指令，用于在调试时同步块中的所有线程，确保线程间的执行顺序。在同一块中的所有其他线程也到达该点之前，任何线程都不会继续执行该调用。"
msgstr ""
"`debug_barrier` inserts a barrier instruction to synchronize all threads in "
"a block during debugging, ensuring execution order among threads. No thread "
"will continue past this call until all other threads in the same block have "
"reached this point."

