msgid "**注意：** `debug_barrier` 主要用于调试，通常不应在性能关键的生产代码中使用，因为它可能会因同步而引入开销。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** `debug_barrier` is mainly used for debugging and should generally "
"not be used in performance-critical production code, as it may introduce "
"overhead due to synchronization."
